# Getting started

This package exposes a single bridge entry point, [`run`](render_pkg.md#item-render_5fpkg-run).

The host supplies [`emit`](render_pkg.md#item-render_5fpkg-emit) for output. Its signature:
`host fn emit(value: S) -> .;`.

- Step one.
- Step two.

## Example

A quick taste of Kio (not type-checked here):

```kio {ignore}
// Identity on the host string type.
fn echo(x: S) -> S { x }
```

