<h3 id="item-render_5fpkg-run"><code>run</code> <span class="item-kind">fn</span></h3>

<pre class="sig"><code><span class="kio-keyword-declaration">pub</span> <span class="kio-keyword-declaration">fn</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-function">run</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">(</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">)</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">-&gt;</span> <span class="kio-punctuation-separator">.</span></code></pre>

The package's public entry point.

<h3 id="item-render_5fpkg_2fmain-identity"><code>identity</code> <span class="item-kind">fn</span></h3>

<pre class="sig"><code><span class="kio-keyword-declaration">pub</span> <span class="kio-keyword-declaration">fn</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-function">identity</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">[</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">]</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">(</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">x</span><span class="kio-operator-builtin">:</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">)</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">-&gt;</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">A</span></code></pre>

Returns its argument unchanged.

The signature is `pub fn identity[A](x: A) -> A`.

<h3 id="item-render_5fpkg_2fmain-Pair"><code>Pair</code> <span class="item-kind">type</span></h3>

<pre class="sig"><code><span class="kio-keyword-declaration">pub</span> <span class="kio-keyword-declaration">type</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">Pair</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">[</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">]</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">=</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">A</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">&amp;</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-separator">;</span></code></pre>

A two-component product of `A` values.

<h3 id="item-render_5fpkg_2fsub_2futil-drop"><code>drop</code> <span class="item-kind">fn</span></h3>

<pre class="sig"><code><span class="kio-keyword-declaration">pub</span> <span class="kio-keyword-declaration">fn</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-function">drop</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">[</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">]</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">(</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">x</span><span class="kio-operator-builtin">:</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">A</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">)</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">-&gt;</span> <span class="kio-punctuation-separator">.</span></code></pre>

Discards its argument and returns unit.


