<main>
<h1>Getting started</h1>
<p>This package exposes a single bridge entry point, <a href="render_pkg.html#item-render_5fpkg-run"><code>run</code></a>.</p>
<p>The host supplies <a href="render_pkg.html#item-render_5fpkg-emit"><code>emit</code></a> for output. Its signature: <code>host fn emit(value: S) -&gt; .;</code>.</p>
<ul>
<li>Step one.</li>
<li>Step two.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Example</h2>
<p>A quick taste of Kio (not type-checked here):</p>
<pre><code class="language-kio"><span class="kio-comment-line">// Identity on the host string type.</span>
<span class="kio-keyword-declaration">fn</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-function">echo</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">(</span><span class="kio-variable-parameter">x</span><span class="kio-operator-builtin">:</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">S</span><span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">)</span> <span class="kio-operator-builtin">-&gt;</span> <span class="kio-entity-name-type">S</span> <span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">{</span> <span class="kio-identifier">x</span> <span class="kio-punctuation-bracket">}</span>
</code></pre>
</main>
</div>
</body>
